WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Yeah

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
They said it was a rush

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
But it was a heist

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Uranium heist, uranium heist

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Try to steal our uranium in the dead of night

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Commandos, Rangers, Black Hawks in the fight

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Failed miserably

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Just like Tabas, right?

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
They flew deep into ice, Farhan thought we wouldn't see

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Special forces, excavators trying to take our enriched uranium for free

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.700
Attacked our defenses, tried to seize the ground

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:34.220
But we lit them up, now the birds are down

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:36.800
See one toughie gone, Blackhawks burning in the sand

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.340
Six hundred million wasted on a failed master plan

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:41.840
They called it a rescue, but the world knows the truth

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:44.420
They came for our uranium, that's the real proof

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:46.740
We said it clear, this wasn't random at all

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:49.380
They wanted our nuclear material, that was the goal

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:51.800
Deep into our territory, under constant threat

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:54.760
But they got exposed, now the whole world sees their regrets

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:57.240
Fell like Tabas, history repeating again

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:59.860
Superpower embarrassed, losing more than just man

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:03.040
You tried to rob us in the middle of the war, now you're running scared

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:06.080
We laugh from afar, sacred defense

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:10.400
Uranium safe

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:14.740
Stop running away, keep your boots on the ground
